WEBVTT

00:08.770 --> 00:15.380
<b>Picking up the yesterday that
someone threw away</b>

00:15.380 --> 00:18.710
<b>I just reached my hand out like a daredevil</b>

00:18.710 --> 00:22.020
<b>Thrusting the answer out</b>

00:22.020 --> 00:27.460
<b>No matter what I get, I won't ever be satisfied</b>

00:28.660 --> 00:34.600
<b>Escape from the gaps in your
tangled up heart</b>

00:34.600 --> 00:36.670
<b>That's right, make a treasure</b>

00:36.670 --> 00:41.900
<b>I hear your voice in the rusted time</b>

00:41.900 --> 00:44.940
<b>I want to deliver it just as it is</b>

00:44.940 --> 00:48.210
<b>You are waiting in the light</b>

00:48.210 --> 00:51.810
<b>That's what I believe</b>

00:51.810 --> 00:55.480
<b>Right away</b>

01:06.030 --> 01:08.060
<b>So, make a treasure</b>

01:08.060 --> 01:13.300
<b>I search for myself in the rusted mirror</b>

01:13.300 --> 01:16.400
<b>I want to seize it with my own hands</b>

01:16.400 --> 01:19.640
<b>You are waiting, no matter where I am</b>

01:19.640 --> 01:23.210
<b>That's what I believe</b>

01:23.210 --> 01:25.870
<b>Right away</b>

01:35.560 --> 01:39.260
<b>Homura has finally commenced the
creation of a new Heaven and Earth,</b>

01:39.260 --> 01:41.630
<b>which is his true objective.</b>

01:45.870 --> 01:51.310
<b>Sanzo's group charges into
the Tower of Konran,</b>

01:51.310 --> 01:55.140
<b>Homura's stronghold, to take back
the stolen Maten Scripture.</b>

02:03.120 --> 02:06.690
<b>Intending to hold off Gairu and his men,
who stand in their way,</b>

02:06.690 --> 02:11.520
<b>Cho Hakkai lays hands upon his
own demon power limiter.</b>

02:26.640 --> 02:31.780
<b>This is clearly an act of treason
against the Heavens!</b>

02:31.780 --> 02:34.450
<b>If we allow Homura's actions
to go unchecked,</b>

02:34.450 --> 02:37.950
<b>it's obvious the Heavens will
suffer harm as well.</b>

02:37.950 --> 02:41.060
<b>I propose Homura be dismissed
from his service as War Prince,</b>

02:41.060 --> 02:47.230
<b>followed by the subjugation of
Homura by the new War Prince.</b>

02:47.230 --> 02:48.700
<b>No objections!</b>

02:50.730 --> 02:53.240
<b>No objections is all fine and good,</b>

02:53.240 --> 02:56.810
<b>but who do you intend to appoint
as the new War Prince?</b>

02:56.810 --> 02:58.540
<b>Merciful Goddess!</b>

02:58.540 --> 03:00.010
<b>That is...</b>

03:00.680 --> 03:02.640
<b>Nataku is useless.</b>

03:02.640 --> 03:06.180
<b>Or is there someone else
who's suited to the task?</b>

03:06.180 --> 03:09.580
<b>But we can't just sit back and watch.</b>

03:09.580 --> 03:12.090
<b>All you have to do IS sit back and watch.</b>

03:12.090 --> 03:13.460
<b>Merciful Goddess!</b>

03:13.460 --> 03:15.820
<b>How can you say such an
irresponsible thing?!</b>

03:15.820 --> 03:17.950
<b>Gods exist only to be witnesses.</b>

03:19.530 --> 03:21.660
<b>Isn't that how it is?</b>

03:21.660 --> 03:24.770
<b>Besides, it's not every day</b>

03:24.770 --> 03:26.890
<b>you get to see such an interesting show.</b>

03:41.480 --> 03:42.950
<b>Let's go!</b>

03:50.290 --> 03:51.780
<b>Shall we get started?</b>

03:53.060 --> 03:54.530
<b>You're...</b>

04:23.730 --> 04:25.190
<b>Thanks for the food!</b>

04:27.260 --> 04:28.990
<b>It's sure to be a trap, damn it!</b>

04:30.600 --> 04:32.730
<b>Do you even understand our situation?</b>

04:32.730 --> 04:35.540
<b>You stupid monkey with a
stomach for a brain.</b>

04:35.540 --> 04:37.000
<b>Don't call me a monkey!</b>

04:38.510 --> 04:40.170
<b>What're you trying to pull here?!</b>

04:46.110 --> 04:48.950
<b>Don't worry. It's not been poisoned.</b>

04:48.950 --> 04:50.850
<b>It's a small act of kindness,</b>

04:50.850 --> 04:53.050
<b>to allow you to enjoy your last supper.</b>

04:53.860 --> 04:57.880
<b>Is that so? How thoughtful of you.
Here's my thanks!</b>

05:01.200 --> 05:02.660
<b>These guys...</b>

05:03.770 --> 05:05.230
<b>Gods, after all.</b>

05:06.970 --> 05:09.800
<b>We're Lord Homura's personal bodyguards!</b>

05:10.570 --> 05:13.440
<b>We accompanied Lord Homura and
descended from the Heavens!</b>

05:14.440 --> 05:18.170
<b>We're prepared to give our lives for
Lord Homura at any time.</b>

05:18.780 --> 05:22.110
<b>Giving up your life for someone else?</b>

05:22.720 --> 05:26.650
<b>Lord Homura's truly a man worthy of such.</b>

05:28.790 --> 05:31.760
<b>We'll explain that to you in great detail.</b>

05:32.690 --> 05:34.160
<b>Now, take your seats.</b>

05:38.470 --> 05:39.930
<b>Gojyo!</b>

05:46.780 --> 05:50.970
<b>Hey, how could you waste all that?!
You pervy water sprite!</b>

05:54.450 --> 05:56.550
<b>I just hate guys like you,</b>

05:56.550 --> 06:00.650
<b>who talk about doing this or
that for someone else's sake.</b>

06:02.790 --> 06:04.260
<b>Such lowly beings.</b>

06:05.060 --> 06:06.580
<b>That's just perfect.</b>

06:07.430 --> 06:09.830
<b>Hey, that was dangerous!</b>

06:09.830 --> 06:12.570
<b>It's your fault for standing
there daydreaming.</b>

06:12.570 --> 06:14.900
<b>You'll just get in the way, so go get lost.</b>

06:14.900 --> 06:15.670
<b>What'd you say?!</b>

06:15.670 --> 06:17.130
<b>Let's go, Goku!</b>

06:19.870 --> 06:22.010
<b>What? But...</b>

06:22.010 --> 06:25.310
<b>I don't like being watched.</b>

06:25.310 --> 06:26.780
<b>Okay...</b>

06:28.720 --> 06:31.950
<b>I'm not chanting any sutras
for you if you croak.</b>

06:32.850 --> 06:37.810
<b>Yes, Sir. I'm so grateful it's making
me cry, you stinking monk.</b>

06:39.330 --> 06:40.820
<b>We'll be going on ahead then.</b>

06:41.500 --> 06:42.960
<b>You're not going anywhere!</b>

06:46.470 --> 06:50.340
<b>I told you I'd be your opponent here!</b>

06:50.910 --> 06:56.100
<b>Absurd! A mere demon intends
to fight us gods alone?!</b>

06:56.640 --> 06:59.510
<b>You forget yourself! We'll teach you a lesson!</b>

07:01.350 --> 07:03.790
<b>I don't care about gods and things.</b>

07:03.790 --> 07:06.810
<b>I don't like you, so I'll beat
you to a pulp! That's all.</b>

07:23.300 --> 07:25.740
<b>The first stage is complete.</b>

07:25.740 --> 07:27.540
<b>Entering stage two.</b>

07:28.340 --> 07:31.310
<b>So, it doesn't matter if we
step away from here?</b>

07:31.310 --> 07:35.750
<b>No. These Scriptures have served
their purpose as well.</b>

07:36.420 --> 07:37.880
<b>All right.</b>

07:39.120 --> 07:43.930
<b>Oh, man, standing still isn't my thing.</b>

07:43.930 --> 07:47.130
<b>The energy necessary to create
the new Heaven and Earth</b>

07:47.130 --> 07:50.370
<b>is gradually gathering with the
tower as its focal point.</b>

07:50.370 --> 07:55.460
<b>What we need next is the key to
open the door to the new world.</b>

07:56.140 --> 07:57.810
<b>Son Goku, right?</b>

07:57.810 --> 07:58.740
<b>Yes.</b>

07:58.740 --> 08:01.170
<b>Then I guess we'll go get him.</b>

08:03.610 --> 08:05.080
<b>Yeah.</b>

08:08.780 --> 08:10.440
<b>Impossible!</b>

08:11.220 --> 08:13.690
<b>Defeated by a mere demon?!</b>

08:19.860 --> 08:22.960
<b>All right! Who's next?!</b>

08:23.730 --> 08:27.040
<b>Is he really just an ordinary demon?!</b>

08:27.040 --> 08:29.870
<b>His strength... His combat technique...</b>

08:29.870 --> 08:31.840
<b>I feel as though I remember
seeing this before.</b>

08:46.690 --> 08:48.360
<b>Could it be...</b>

08:48.360 --> 08:49.820
<b>That this man is...</b>

09:02.470 --> 09:04.030
<b>Come on, come on, come on!</b>

09:05.410 --> 09:09.000
<b>Why're you having such a hard time
against one little demon?!</b>

09:43.410 --> 09:45.450
<b>Truly, he's Kenren!</b>

09:45.450 --> 09:47.280
<b>What? Who the hell's that?</b>

09:48.050 --> 09:49.710
<b>You sure gave me a good deal of trouble!</b>

09:52.520 --> 09:56.580
<b>Oh, dear, is it over already?</b>

09:57.230 --> 09:58.690
<b>You're late.</b>

09:59.760 --> 10:01.230
<b>That seems to be the case.</b>

10:03.430 --> 10:05.190
<b>Hey, now, you okay?</b>

10:06.900 --> 10:10.600
<b>Well, I got serious for the first time
in goodness knows how long.</b>

10:11.440 --> 10:12.810
<b>Gojyo!</b>

10:12.810 --> 10:12.940
<b>What?!
Gojyo!</b>

10:12.940 --> 10:14.240
<b>What?!</b>

10:15.140 --> 10:18.980
<b>I no longer have enough
strength to stop you,</b>

10:18.980 --> 10:22.650
<b>but I'll never allow you to pass through here!</b>

10:22.650 --> 10:24.420
<b>The Curse of Kaizai!</b>

10:24.420 --> 10:25.990
<b>Get the hell off of me!</b>

10:25.990 --> 10:27.790
<b>It's too late.</b>

10:27.790 --> 10:31.490
<b>My Curse of Kaizai has already been cast.</b>

10:31.490 --> 10:35.460
<b>It's a spell that forces you to fight
a past you can't escape.</b>

10:35.460 --> 10:39.020
<b>It'll never become undone,
even upon my death.</b>

10:40.300 --> 10:44.760
<b>You shall die again, General Kenren!</b>

10:45.870 --> 10:48.470
<b>Whatever! My name's Sha Gojyo!</b>

10:52.050 --> 10:53.410
<b>Gojyo...</b>

10:53.410 --> 10:55.210
<b>Right, that's my...</b>

11:00.460 --> 11:01.920
<b>Gojyo!</b>

11:05.460 --> 11:06.930
<b>Gojyo...</b>

11:16.700 --> 11:18.170
<b>Gojyo...</b>

11:23.950 --> 11:25.410
<b>Mom?</b>

11:33.120 --> 11:35.060
<b>It's awfully quiet.</b>

11:35.060 --> 11:37.990
<b>If you think so, then you be quiet too.</b>

11:37.990 --> 11:43.060
<b>But I'm bored! There haven't even
been any enemies for a while.</b>

11:43.060 --> 11:46.100
<b>You're so laid back. Consider the situation!</b>

11:46.100 --> 11:47.970
<b>What?</b>

11:47.970 --> 11:49.800
<b>Never mind, I was an idiot for asking.</b>

11:50.640 --> 11:53.200
<b>Then quit holding back and just tell me!</b>

11:53.980 --> 11:56.340
<b>If it's this quiet, it means we're
already in an area</b>

11:56.340 --> 12:00.210
<b>that the small fry aren't allowed to enter.</b>

12:00.850 --> 12:02.320
<b>In other words...</b>

12:04.390 --> 12:06.180
<b>It means we're near our goal!</b>

12:08.990 --> 12:10.220
<b>Homura!</b>

12:10.220 --> 12:12.130
<b>Well done, to come this far.</b>

12:12.130 --> 12:14.060
<b>We've been waiting.</b>

12:14.060 --> 12:17.960
<b>Well, I heard that something I'd lost
was being held here.</b>

12:18.600 --> 12:20.640
<b>Might that be the Scripture?</b>

12:20.640 --> 12:23.000
<b>Helpful of you to be so quick to understand.</b>

12:23.000 --> 12:25.310
<b>If you want it, I'll return it to you.</b>

12:25.310 --> 12:28.610
<b>But in exchange, I'll take Son Goku.</b>

12:28.610 --> 12:30.080
<b>What?!</b>

12:36.380 --> 12:37.850
<b>Gojyo!</b>

12:39.690 --> 12:41.150
<b>Mom!</b>

12:44.230 --> 12:46.190
<b>Why are you...</b>

12:48.400 --> 12:49.860
<b>Gojyo!</b>

12:51.630 --> 12:56.970
<b>It's an illusion, Gojyo. This is most
likely the Curse of Kaizai.</b>

12:56.970 --> 12:59.060
<b>Yeah, I know.</b>

13:00.040 --> 13:03.010
<b>That's right. Back then, Mom...</b>

13:30.470 --> 13:33.960
<b>Shut the hell up! You're only an illusion!</b>

13:44.890 --> 13:46.350
<b>What the heck is love anyway?</b>

13:47.460 --> 13:49.050
<b>Not like I want it or anything.</b>

13:50.160 --> 13:53.220
<b>Just that, Mom was always crying, so...</b>

13:59.770 --> 14:01.230
<b>Mom, look. Here.</b>

14:02.070 --> 14:04.840
<b>The man at the flower shop
said these are for you.</b>

14:04.840 --> 14:06.410
<b>My, really?</b>

14:06.410 --> 14:07.940
<b>What a beautiful</b>

14:07.940 --> 14:09.380
<b>bloody color!</b>

14:13.510 --> 14:16.180
<b>Stop! That hurts! Mom!</b>

14:16.180 --> 14:17.990
<b>How disgustingly ugly!</b>

14:17.990 --> 14:21.320
<b>Ugly, just like the blood of that woman!</b>

14:23.290 --> 14:24.780
<b>The love I couldn't obtain...</b>

14:25.830 --> 14:27.560
<b>The vision that vanished into a sea of blood...</b>

14:30.030 --> 14:31.500
<b>Gojyo!</b>

14:37.710 --> 14:39.610
<b>Stop...</b>

14:39.610 --> 14:41.070
<b>Please stop!</b>

14:42.410 --> 14:44.400
<b>Please stop it, Mom!</b>

14:46.450 --> 14:49.080
<b>I told you before that such
things don't work against me.</b>

14:56.360 --> 14:58.520
<b>You certainly leave no time
for me to lower my guard.</b>

15:01.860 --> 15:03.730
<b>Whoops...</b>

15:03.730 --> 15:05.200
<b>You're going to stay quiet.</b>

15:08.670 --> 15:09.840
<b>Hakuryu!</b>

15:09.840 --> 15:11.300
<b>You too!</b>

15:21.950 --> 15:23.420
<b>Sanzo!</b>

15:24.020 --> 15:26.080
<b>Your opponent is over here!</b>

15:50.180 --> 15:51.640
<b>Longer, Nyoi-bou!</b>

15:55.380 --> 15:57.950
<b>He's become...</b>

15:57.950 --> 16:00.220
<b>Clearly stronger than before.</b>

16:06.060 --> 16:07.860
<b>That's good, Son Goku.</b>

16:07.860 --> 16:10.390
<b>That strength is exactly what I've been after.</b>

16:16.640 --> 16:18.100
<b>Goku...</b>

16:25.580 --> 16:27.210
<b>Goku!</b>

16:27.210 --> 16:29.980
<b>Man, just barely managed
it with all three of us.</b>

16:29.980 --> 16:32.480
<b>He's become incredibly strong.</b>

16:33.450 --> 16:35.090
<b>I'll leave the rest to you.</b>

16:35.090 --> 16:36.560
<b>Yes, Sir.</b>

16:37.560 --> 16:40.530
<b>Wake up, Goku! You stupid monkey!</b>

16:41.260 --> 16:42.730
<b>Goku!</b>

16:44.970 --> 16:46.900
<b>Talk about poor service.</b>

16:46.900 --> 16:48.640
<b>Weren't you going to let me see</b>

16:48.640 --> 16:50.630
<b>the creation of your new Heaven and Earth?</b>

16:53.170 --> 16:57.550
<b>Even the smallest mistake is not
permitted in its creation.</b>

16:57.550 --> 17:02.780
<b>We must keep separate anything
that may prove to be trouble.</b>

17:02.780 --> 17:04.950
<b>So, you're treating us like roaches.</b>

17:04.950 --> 17:08.890
<b>No, all of you fought admirably,</b>

17:08.890 --> 17:11.450
<b>enough to gain our respect.</b>

17:13.990 --> 17:15.460
<b>So long.</b>

17:31.310 --> 17:33.280
<b>Gyumaoh's son.</b>

17:33.280 --> 17:34.750
<b>What do you want?</b>

17:35.350 --> 17:38.190
<b>I've come to return past favors.</b>

17:38.190 --> 17:41.550
<b>I don't like being on the losing end forever.</b>

17:42.520 --> 17:44.290
<b>Little Lirin's here too!</b>

17:45.730 --> 17:47.630
<b>Please fight back, Gojyo!</b>

17:49.300 --> 17:50.790
<b>I know!</b>

17:52.830 --> 17:54.300
<b>Damn it!</b>

18:04.410 --> 18:09.380
<b>That's not right! Gojyo's mother
was a normal demon!</b>

18:09.380 --> 18:11.440
<b>My attack should be effective!</b>

18:13.150 --> 18:14.620
<b>Gojyo!</b>

18:18.030 --> 18:20.290
<b>Because my mom would always
look at me and cry...</b>

18:21.160 --> 18:23.530
<b>Because she would see a shadow
of the man she loved in me</b>

18:23.530 --> 18:26.060
<b>and the phantom visage of the other
woman who bore me and cry...</b>

18:27.400 --> 18:30.870
<b>If my death would make Mom stop crying,</b>

18:30.870 --> 18:32.340
<b>I thought it was okay.</b>

18:33.770 --> 18:36.830
<b>Are you going to make me
do it again, Gojyo?!</b>

18:41.750 --> 18:43.250
<b>Bro!</b>

18:43.250 --> 18:46.290
<b>Miss Yaone, why in the world are you...</b>

18:46.290 --> 18:48.860
<b>We've been watching all this time</b>

18:48.860 --> 18:51.830
<b>for a chance to take back
the Seiten Scripture.</b>

18:51.830 --> 18:53.560
<b>Since you guys launched your assault,</b>

18:53.560 --> 18:56.590
<b>we came, figuring it was the
perfect opportunity, but...</b>

18:57.770 --> 18:59.230
<b>This is pitiful.</b>

19:00.400 --> 19:04.310
<b>The enemy cast a spell called
the Curse of Kaizai.</b>

19:04.310 --> 19:07.140
<b>It's a spell that forces you to fight
a past you can't escape.</b>

19:08.280 --> 19:12.910
<b>A past you can't escape? As if anything
like that even exists!</b>

19:12.910 --> 19:13.750
<b>What?!</b>

19:13.750 --> 19:19.020
<b>The past... Sure, it might chase you if
you try to run from it,</b>

19:19.020 --> 19:21.490
<b>but if you face it head-on,</b>

19:21.490 --> 19:24.990
<b>it's just the old memories
you have inside you.</b>

19:24.990 --> 19:26.760
<b>There's nothing there to be afraid of.</b>

19:27.490 --> 19:30.230
<b>Dokugakuji, you...</b>

19:30.230 --> 19:33.900
<b>Yes, long ago, I took her life.</b>

19:33.900 --> 19:35.740
<b>That's the truth.</b>

19:35.740 --> 19:38.860
<b>I'll never turn my back on that truth!</b>

19:40.770 --> 19:43.510
<b>You open up your eyes and take a look!</b>

19:43.510 --> 19:45.210
<b>Look at what your past is made of!</b>

19:49.620 --> 19:51.080
<b>Don't look away!</b>

19:53.990 --> 19:57.490
<b>You felt it'd be okay to be
killed by your mother.</b>

19:57.490 --> 19:59.930
<b>Those emotions are what's
making her stronger.</b>

20:01.760 --> 20:03.200
<b>Gojyo!</b>

20:04.730 --> 20:06.630
<b>All of you...</b>

20:06.630 --> 20:08.100
<b>Just shut the hell up!</b>

20:17.140 --> 20:22.310
<b>Mom was more beautiful.</b>

20:26.750 --> 20:28.480
<b>Now, let us begin.</b>

20:32.490 --> 20:36.430
<b>The time has come for the door to the
new Heaven and Earth to open.</b>

20:46.670 --> 20:55.480
<b>All people coming and going
carry heavy burdens</b>

20:56.850 --> 21:07.250
<b>Find tomorrow within the mirage
wavering in the distance</b>

21:08.600 --> 21:18.730
<b>Emotions like the sand spilling
out of my hands</b>

21:20.070 --> 21:33.050
<b>The words that pierced my heart back
then suddenly ache</b>

21:33.050 --> 21:44.500
<b>Counting the endless nights,
I search for pieces of me</b>

21:44.500 --> 21:55.780
<b>The more I lose, the more certain
this feeling becomes</b>

21:55.780 --> 22:07.950
<b>Now, I can surely walk on and on forever</b>
